const PALETTES=[["#ff4f78","#6d2049","#ffd84d"],["#a56cff","#412777","#64f0d2"],["#ff9e42","#77342d","#fff06a"],["#4ce081","#176553","#ff63c2"],["#4bb7ff","#263f77","#ffd34e"],["#f0ecdf","#55536c","#ff4f78"]];
const rarityStats={COMMON:[96,116],UNCOMMON:[124,156],RARE:[168,208],BOSS:[340,430]},stop=new Set(["今天","现在","那个","这个","感觉","觉得","真的","特别","非常","就是","还是","然后","已经","自己","有个","一个"]);
function hash(text){let h=2166136261;for(const c of text){h^=c.charCodeAt(0);h=Math.imul(h,16777619)}return h>>>0}function rng(seed){let v=seed||1;return()=>{v=v+0x6D2B79F5|0;let t=Math.imul(v^v>>>15,1|v);t=t+Math.imul(t^t>>>7,61|t)^t;return((t^t>>>14)>>>0)/4294967296}}const choose=(a,r)=>a[Math.floor(r()*a.length)],range=(a,r)=>Math.round(a[0]+r()*(a[1]-a[0]));
export function hasImmediateSafetyRisk(text){const n=text.replace(/\s+/g,"");return/(我)?(现在|马上|今晚|待会)?.{0,4}(想|要|准备|打算)(自杀|死掉|去死|结束生命|割腕|跳楼|跳下去|吞药)|已经.{0,4}(割腕|吞药)|不想活了.*(马上|现在)/.test(n)&&!/(不想|不会|没有|别).*?(自杀|伤害自己|去死)/.test(n)}
function words(text){return[...new Set(text.replace(/[，。！？、,.!?；;：“”"（）()]/g," ").split(/\s+/).flatMap(s=>s.length>8?s.match(/.{2,5}/g)||[s]:[s]).filter(x=>x.length>1&&!stop.has(x)))].slice(0,7)}
